"1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="115000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1200"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>As humans, we </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>love</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t> growth. We like when our kids go from crawling to walking, or from not speaking to speaking. We like when they graduate high school and attend college. </a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="115000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1200"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="1100"/><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>(@self is this just personal ranting or actually beneficial) This also results in </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>Superficial societal games of whose got the nicest car or biggest house when these things are just games and that survival is possible without this aspect, although it might not be as interesting. </a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="115000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1200"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="1" lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>Competition -&gt; Chiefs, Wins/Losses(?), Creates Leaders, Brings people together.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr b="1" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="115000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1200"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>We love competition, it has to be done right, but we love it. In KC we have the chiefs, and we love the chiefs, they are amazing. Theres wins and losses and celebrations of victory. People idolize, encourage, and support competition. It is one of the most motivating aspects of humans. And interestingly enough the losses are often more impactful than the wins. I remember calling my mother during some games and all the sudden she would just screaming. Touchdowns, turnovers, etc. The mistakes teach us what we did wrong, and the successes teach us what we did right. Also, the losses build resilience, which is largely missing in our children today. Anyway, when designing competition we have to be very careful. I have a ton of ideas here and would love some input to make it even better. </a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="115000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1200"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="1" lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>Loot &amp; Rewards -&gt; Christmas</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr b="1" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:sr